# Parallel branches all prepend to CHANGELOG.md; union merge keeps both
# sides' entries instead of conflicting. After any merge that touches the
# changelog, renumber your entry to the unique highest version — see
# AGENTS.md ("knowledge/changelogs/CHANGELOG.md in parallel branches"). Note: GitHub's merge
# button ignores custom drivers; this applies to local merges (the
# documented conflict-resolution path: git merge origin/dev).
knowledge/changelogs/CHANGELOG.md merge=union
